# Comments & Safe Changes

## 1. Comments on every change

- **Har change ke saath comment likho** – chahe user ne bola ho ya na bola ho.
- Jo bhi code block edit/ add karo, uske andar short comment add karo taaki:
  - code ka **function/ purpose** clear ho,
  - koi baad mein edit kare to **galat jagah change karke functionality na bigaade**.
- Comment code ke saath hi rahe: relevant line(s) ke upar ya same line par (inline), taaki edit karte waqt dikhe.

**Example:** Naya variable/ hook add kiya to usi ke paas comment – kyon use ho raha hai, kab 1 vs 2 (jaise calendar months).

---

## 2. Change se pehle existing comments check karo

- **Jab user koi change karne ko kahe**, pehle us area ke **existing comments** dekho.
- Agar change **un comments ke against jayega** (logic/ behaviour badal raha ho jisko comment explain karta hai), to:
  - **Pehle user se poochho:** "Yahan comment ke hisaab se [X] karna tha; aapka change [Y] isse ulta ho sakta hai. Kya phir bhi aise change karna hai?"
  - User confirm kare, **tab** change karo aur **comment bhi update** karo taaki nayi behaviour sahi describe ho.

Isse accidental breakage nahi hogi aur intent clear rahega.
